{"ID":"20251114152251-25h57we","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251114152251-25h57we","title":"UPL9-17-c——数据输入规则","type":"doc","updated":"20251121113104"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114174507-faqhig6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114174507-faqhig6","updated":"20251114175856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20251114174513-40tgveh","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114174513-40tgveh","updated":"20251114175856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"computeShader.SetFloat()\t\t// 设置float类型基本数据\ncomputeShader.SetInt()\t\t\t// 设置int类型基本数据，也可以用于设置uint类型数据\ncomputeShader.SetBool()\t\t\t// 设置bool类型基本数据\ncomputeShader.SetVector()\t\t// 设置float4(Vector4)向量数据，也可以用于非float4(Vector4)向量数据传递\ncomputeShader.SetFloats()\t\t// 可以用于设置float3, float2向量数据，也可以用于设置float数组数据\ncomputeShader.SetInts()\t\t\t// 可以用于设置int3, int2向量数据，也可以用于设置int数组数据\ncomputeShader.SetMatrix()\t\t// 设置float4x4(Matrix4x4)矩阵，如果要传递非4x4矩阵需要在ComputeShader内自行截取\ncomputeShader.SetBuffer()\t\t// 设置ComputeBuffer缓冲区数据\ncomputeShader.SetTexture()\t\t// 设置纹理数据\nComputeBuffer\t\t\t\t\t// 存储ComputeShader缓冲区的类，实例化时需要传入缓冲区内存储的元素数量，单个元素字节数，缓冲区类型\nComputeBufferType.Raw\t\t\t// 如果传递的是ByteAddressBuffer/RWByteAddressBuffer，实例化ComputeShader时，传入此枚举\nComputeBufferType.Append\t\t// 如果传递的是AppendStructuredBuffer\u003cT\u003e/ConsumeStructuredBuffer\u003cT\u003e，实例化ComputeShader时，传入此枚举\ncomputeBuffer.SetData()\t\t\t// 将待传递的数据设置在缓冲区内\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251114152251-kikm0i0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114152251-kikm0i0","updated":"20251114170914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU侧（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 侧）的数据输入规则"}]},{"ID":"20251114152319-zfa2d4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114152319-zfa2d4f","updated":"20251114154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们上一节学习了 Compute Shader 中的各种数据类型\n而这些类型的数据都需要从 CPU 侧（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中）进行输入之后，才能在 GPU 中利用这些数据进行计算\n因此，这里主要阐述 C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 侧如何向 Compute Shader 中输入数据"}]},{"ID":"20251114152423-ixajk5w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"alias":"computeShader.SetInt(),computeShader.SetBool()","id":"20251114152423-ixajk5w","name":"computeShader.SetFloat()","updated":"20251114170914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"标量数据输入"}]},{"ID":"20251114152443-bte2c1a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114152443-bte2c1a","updated":"20251114155149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114152533-5hu3ik3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114152533-5hu3ik3","updated":"20251114152533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114152533-e0hki9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114152533-e0hki9k","updated":"20251114152538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251114152534-st3k8rc","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114152534-st3k8rc","updated":"20251114152617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"computeShader.SetFloat(\"name\", value)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114152533-hnwltrq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114152533-hnwltrq","updated":"20251114155149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114152533-vpkw0wo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114152533-vpkw0wo","updated":"20251114152551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"uint"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251114155125-n5no9s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114155125-n5no9s7","updated":"20251114155149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"uint"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 没有专门的输入 API，因此直接使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SetInt()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 方法"}]},{"ID":"20251114152551-fsa4l3u","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114152551-fsa4l3u","updated":"20251114152629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"computeShader.SetInt(\"name\", value)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114152533-m8i0bxg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251114152533-m8i0bxg","updated":"20251114152533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114152533-d5carx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114152533-d5carx9","updated":"20251114153722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bool"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251114152637-srhhd8k","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114152637-srhhd8k","updated":"20251114154806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="}